DECLARE `er6 Facts about a week` HAS
    `workers’ compensation payments received or to be received, other than a lump sum or pension paid in full and final settlement of a claim`        IS A BOOLEAN   -- (a)(i)
    `earnings under a wage-loss indemnity plan by reason of illness, injury, quarantine, pregnancy or care of a child received or to be received`        IS A BOOLEAN   -- (a)(ii)
